    "## Usage\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Edit `TARGET_NAME`, `INSTRUMENT`, `RADIUS`, and optionally `PROGRAM_ID`.\n",
    "2. Run all cells.\n",
    "3. The notebook will search MAST, download a candidate FITS cube, build a preview video, and save a false-color still image."
   ]
